          "snippet": {
            "line": 158,
            "text": "theorem energyShift_bounds {d : TailData} {K : ℝ} (w : ResetWitness d K) (hK : 0 < K) (eta : ℝ)\n    (heta : eta ^ 2 ≤ 1) :\n    |energyShift d w.coefficients eta| ≤ combinedScale d K ∧\n      |deriv (energyShift d w.coefficients) eta| ≤ combinedScale d K"
